35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The closeout files show catalogue-style awards still drawing users a decade on.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,Staffing rolls show most trained phenotyping technicians left for industry.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The animal facility cleared accreditation, but glasshouse blocks are booked solid.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Ledgers show vehicle-hire lines frozen, but shipping charges climbed.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,Incident logs show the spectroscopy suite idle for eleven weeks last year.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Ryuji, that staffing loss is a serious concern for any wet-lab project.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Victoria, if the glasshouse is full, field-based work might be safer.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, frozen travel costs help, but the facility load is the real risk.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, idle equipment is a major bottleneck for spectroscopy-heavy proposals.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shizue, I agree, the long-term utility of data seems more reliable.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The portfolio review found breeding colonies overrun schedule twice as often.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,Minutes note both senior modelling analysts are seconded abroad until autumn.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The national computing agreement covers simulation hours at no charge.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The national repository now clears deposits inside a few weeks.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,Station records show three of five partner field sites lost a season to weather.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Victoria, free computing hours make simulation-based projects much more attractive.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, that aligns with the schedule overrun data you found.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, but if the analysts are gone, who runs the simulations?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, field site instability makes me wary of the microbiome project.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, the repository speed is a huge plus for data-heavy work.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
